  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "We use the BODMAS rule to solve the equation:**\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\nWe apply each option to the given equation:\n\n16 * 6 * 69 * 81 * 3\n\nOption 1) −, +, x, =\n\n16 - 6 + __**69 x 81**__ = 3\n\n__**16**__ - 6 __**+ **____5589__** = 3\n\n__**5605 - 6**__ = 3\n\n5599 ≠ 3 \n\nOption 2) ×, −, =, ÷\n\n16 × 6 - 69 = __**81 ÷ 3**__\n\n__**16 × 6**__ - 69 = 27\n\n__**96 - 69**__ = 27\n\n27 = 27\n\nLHS = RHS\n\nOption 3) ÷, +, =, ×\n\n__**16 ÷ 6**__ + 69 = 81 × 3\n\n2.6 + 69 = __**81 × 3\n\n2.6 +**____** 69**__ = 243\n\n71.6 ≠ 243\n\nOption 4) +, =, ×, −\n\n16 + 6 = __**69 × 81**__ - 3\n\n__**16 + 6**__ = 5589 - 3 \n\n22 = __**5589 - 3**__ \n\n22 ≠ 5586 \n\nHence the correct answer is option 2)",
